      "statusChangeID": "63e3e5542b20f745239052c2",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Thank you for your feedback!\n\nLast year, we made some improvements to make portals more secure. Most notably, users can now create locked instances, and we've added an optional prompt before being taken through a portal.\n\nPlease let us know if you have any feedback regarding our new portals. Some of your requests haven't been addressed (yet!), and separate Canny requests would make it easier for us to track which of your request have and haven't been fulfilled yet.",
